  "handoff_summary": {
    "completed": "Reviewed AisleConfig.swift, AisleConfigParser.swift, MealPlan.swift, MealPlanParser.swift, ShoppingList.swift, all three test suites, the three fixture files, and docs/examples presence. All acceptance criteria are satisfied. API shapes are correct and complete for all three formats. The MealPlan semantic round-trip (parse\u2192serialise\u2192parse equality) is valid. AisleConfig alias lookup uses declaration-order priority with case-insensitive comparison. ShoppingList mutation replaces only the bracket marker character. All imports are Foundation-only; no third-party packages were introduced. All new files are within Packages/CookbookCore/ and the fixture/docs locations.",
